      },
      "attributes": {
        "number": 1,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-25T07:38:56+00:00",
        "contentType": "comment",
        "contentHtml": "<p>FL Connect is the app for people who follow more than one Flarum community and want them all in one place. I have a lot to introduce to make the app better, but with your help and feedback im pretty sure that will become very useful.</p>\n\n<p>For example, the next release will include more languages. So please give feedback!</p>\n\n<p>iOs: <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fl-connect/id6828498019\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fl-connect/id6828498019</a><br>\nAndroid: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flarumconnect.app&amp;hl=en\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flarumconnect.app&amp;hl=en</a></p>\n\n\n<p>Tell me what work, and what not work so i can release more and more fixes.</p>\n\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>\n",
