    {
      "type": "posts",
      "id": "270753",
      "links": {
        "self": "/posts/270753"
      },
      "attributes": {
        "number": 1,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-25T10:36:05+00:00",
        "contentType": "comment",
        "contentHtml": "<p>Hi, Flarum! Welcome to <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Zamorie</a>. It’s a forum for writing fantasy stories together, challenging each other to card battles in the Arena, and talking about the games we can’t put down. Zamorie is now open, so come have a look around.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795600853-303673-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795600853-303673-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"5652eeb7-f16d-4007-b766-914a975e5ca6\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"356\"></a></p>\n\n<h3>🃏 Arenarium</h3>\n<p>My collectible card game now has a dedicated <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/arenaquest\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">quests page</a> and <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/arenacard\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">a card generator</a> where you can turn your own ideas into card designs. I also gave it a new landing page that shows off the game and its artwork. <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/arena\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Arenarium</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795601848-604811-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795601848-604811-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"157917c2-91be-4374-961a-ffcf9fb269f4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"348\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795601884-382777-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795601884-382777-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"be916438-dd35-4e07-9305-2fdaa7e81889\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"203\"></a></p>\n\n<h3>🎲 Roleplay</h3>\n<p>Character progression now lives in your profile, and the system handles the math for you. Creating a character used to mean starting a forum thread. Now there’s a full character editor where you can build your character from scratch. The roleplay section also has a new landing page if you’d like a look around. <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/role\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Roleplay</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602409-193077-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602409-193077-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"0fb14073-9706-4f8d-a694-31be6bf72735\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"359\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602592-34374-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602592-34374-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"142de91f-f63b-4c4b-bf67-7041692ec04a\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"234\"></a></p>\n\n\n<h3>🛍️ Shop</h3>\n<p>The Zamorie <a href=\"https://zamorie.com/market/profile\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> is always open. You can spend tokens, the forum’s shared currency, on profile decorations, Arenarium cards, and roleplay items. You get five tokens when you sign up, enough to buy your first profile decoration. You can equip, swap, or remove decorations right from your profile inventory</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602466-680027-image.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview-Link\"><img class=\"FoFUpload--Upl-Image-Preview\" src=\"https://cdn.discuss.flarum.org/2026-11-25/1795602466-680027-image-thumb.webp\" title=\"image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-id=\"1f14d059-aa3b-4061-89a8-75a725c9f001\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"344\"></a></p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://zamorie.com/\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Zamorie</a> [Заморье] is a Russian word that literally means «the land beyond the sea»</p>",
